s://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123359","id":5680072941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUo8I7Q","user":{"login":"Infini-Creation","id":136735040,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCZpQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136735040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation","html_url":"https://github.com/Infini-Creation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T12:22:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T12:22:07Z","body":"> This seems to be a windows specific issue as the same logic doesn't run into issues on Linux and macOs. I'll take a look at the issue.\n> \n> [@bruvzg](https://github.com/bruvzg) any insights on what the underlying issue could be?\n\nCould it be the calls to \n`output.append_utf8`\n\n(output is a String object)\n\nin\n> editor/export/android_sdk_manager.cpp, AndroidSDKManager::_notification\n\nMy understanding is this will allocate new memory for existing data + new ones each time it is called.\nWhich would explain the huge slowdown and interruption of pretty much everything in the Godot editor as memory allocations are done at a low level.\n\nI think a better way to do it would be be to capture silently command output, parse and extract relevant information (progress and errors) and just update a label every X ms or so, as there is no need for real time update, doing it every second would be enough anyway.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5680072941/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5680123774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123359#issuecomment-5680123774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123359","id":5680123774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUo_Pfg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T12:26:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T12:28:14Z","body":"That is incorrect, it is declared just above so there's no infinite appending, it's not adding to anything each time (it does add data to the output label, but that's done at a reasonable timer limit)\n\n> I think a better way to do it would be be to capture silently command output, parse and extract relevant information (progress and errors) and just update a label every X ms or so, as there is no need for real time update, doing it every second would be enough anyway.\n\nIt does it at an interval, every 3 seconds in fact (i.e. every 3 million microseconds)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5680123774/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]